'''Sketchy '''is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by redeeming the [[Codes|code]] "SK3TCH." It is now only obtainable through trading as the code has since expired.

== Appearance ==
Its blade is orange, which fades into a yellow, with two green dinosaurs imprinted on it. The guard is light green, and the handle is solid black.

==Trivia==  
*This is 1 of 5 YouTuber code knives. The others being [[Denis]], [[Sub]], [[Alex]] and [[Corl]], excluding [[JD]], a [[Legendary Weapons|legendary]] knife.
